'''Always keep risk to a minimum in the Wilderness!''' - Whenever gearing, check your [[Items Kept on Death]] and enable "Wilderness beyond level 20" to make sure important items will not be lost.

The most effective equipment to fight Vet'ion involves a large amount of risk by using items that can be protected with [[Trouver parchment]]s, but most players should opt for cheaper setups until they are confident in their ability to handle PKers. The [[Ursine chainmace]] is by far the most effective weapon against Vet'ion, but comes with additional risk as it must be charged with [[Revenant ether]]. Players should choose three (or four, with [[Protect item]] if you are confident you can mitigate the risk of being [[Smite]]d) valuable with the most strength bonus possible compared to cheaper alternatives.

Note: The benefit from [[Salve amulet (e)]] does not stack with a [[Slayer helmet]]. As Salve amulets are free and kept on death below Level 20 Wilderness they should always be prioritised. 

